  "_note": "Golden frames = dispatch-to-target-destruction in logic frames, captured live against a real C&C Generals install via the headless Unit Validation Ground (BuiltInScenario.UnitValidationGround), using fixed-timestep deterministic stepping. Two consecutive runs produce byte-identical reports. Targets are standardized to TargetHp=30 at spawn so attack completion (destroying the target) is feasible for the whole roster; the measured duration reflects each weapon's real INI damage and fire rate against that HP. Tolerances are deliberate per entry by timing class: fast one-shot destroyers (golden <= 4) use 30% + floor 2; medium multi-shot (golden 9-58) use 20% + floor 3; slow grinders (golden >= 100) use 15% + floor 4. Units absent here are Zero Hour only (ChinaVehicleHelix), unmeasurable in the sandbox (PrimaryActionCatalog.UnmeasurableAttackReasons), or SpecialPower units with no implemented order path. See deep dive P9 2.5/2.7.",
